# 数据库连接（单一变量）· Database connection (single variable)
#   libsql:// 或 http(s)://        → 连 Turso 云（需下面 TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN）
#   本地路径（可带 file: 前缀，相对或绝对）→ 本地 SQLite 文件（相对路径按项目根解析，父目录自动创建）
#   留空                            → 默认本地 data/planet.db（开发零配置可跑）
#   libsql:// or http(s)://        -> connect to Turso cloud (needs TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN below)
#   local path (optional file: prefix, relative or absolute) -> local SQLite file (relative resolved from project root, parent dirs auto-created)
#   empty                          -> defaults to local data/planet.db (zero-config for dev)
#   Turso cloud URL / local file path / empty for default data/planet.db
# 示例·Examples: DATABASE_URL=data/planet.db  或  DATABASE_URL=libsql://<your-db>.turso.io
DATABASE_URL=

# 仅 Turso 云模式需要 · Only required for Turso cloud
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=

# 站点正式地址（canonical / sitemap 域名；库内 site_settings.site_url 优先；也用作导航外链 / 背景音乐的 ilive 基址）
# Canonical site URL (for SEO / sitemap domain; DB site_settings.site_url takes precedence; also the ilive base for nav external link / BGM)
NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://iliveworld.lyc.la

# 是否部署在可信反向代理 / CDN 之后（如 Nginx、Cloudflare）· Behind a trusted reverse proxy / CDN?
#   true  → 点赞等需要真实客户端 IP 的场景会依次读取 X-Forwarded-For / cf-connecting-ip /
#           x-real-ip 转发头（要求反代**覆写**而非追加这些头，否则客户端可伪造 IP）
#   其他/不设置 → 直连部署，只用不可伪造的 TCP socket 对端地址（默认，更安全）
# 本地开发（无代理）不要开启，否则所有请求会被误判成同一个反代 IP。
#   true  -> for features needing the real client IP (e.g. likes), read X-Forwarded-For / cf-connecting-ip /
#            x-real-ip in order (the proxy must **overwrite**, not append, these headers, or clients can spoof IP)
#   other/unset -> direct deployment, use only the unspoofable TCP socket peer address (default, safer)
# Do NOT enable in local dev (no proxy), or every request is misread as the same proxy IP.
NUXT_TRUST_PROXY=

# 点赞接口限流（按归一化 IP 的固定窗口软限流；仅单进程内存计数；不设置则用内置默认 30 次 / 60000 毫秒）
# NUXT_RATELIMIT_LIKE_MAX=0 可完全关闭点赞（合法语义，不会被默认值吞掉）
# Rate limit for likes (fixed-window soft limit per normalized IP; single-process in-memory; defaults to 30 req / 60000 ms when unset)
# Set NUXT_RATELIMIT_LIKE_MAX=0 to fully disable liking (0 takes effect as-is, never swallowed by the default)
# NUXT_RATELIMIT_LIKE_MAX=30
# NUXT_RATELIMIT_LIKE_WINDOW_MS=60000

# 点赞 IP 哈希盐值（concert_likes.ip 存 HMAC-SHA256(盐, IP)，不再落明文 IP）
# Salt for hashing like-IPs (concert_likes.ip stores HMAC-SHA256(salt, IP); no plaintext IP kept)
# ⚠ 生产必须设置随机长字符串，且设置后不可再变更（换盐 = 全部用户点赞去重失效）
# ⚠ Production MUST set a long random string, and never change it afterwards (rotating the salt breaks all like dedup)
# NUXT_IP_SALT=your-long-random-secret
